<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Whirl Skill</h1>
<p>Class and level:
</p>
<pre> Barbarian Level 50
</pre>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> whirl   (while fighting)
</pre>
<p>With a weapon in each hand, the Barbarian whirls them both for a deadly attack: 
a flurry of blows on the one you are fighting. You must already be in a fight, 
and you must fight with two weapons, one wielded and one held (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Hold</a>).
</p><p>Winding up a whirl takes time, so you are slower to act again afterwards. Your 
dexterity and constitution are tested against your opponent's: if the whirl 
fails, you trip up and stumble. A whirl also takes some endurance, and you need 
plenty left to try.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre> &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Barbarian</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hold</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Two Weapon Style</a>
</pre>




</div>